---------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data sources
---------------------------------------------------------------------

egm-contracts describes data formats but does not redistribute any data
itself. The formats it describes are derived from / interoperate with:

  Intracardiac Atrial Fibrillation Database (IAFDB)
  PhysioNet, doi:10.13026/C23S33
  Distributed under the Open Data Commons Attribution License v1.0 (ODC-By v1.0)
  https://physionet.org/content/iafdb/1.0.0/

The IAFDB healthy-trace bank schema (iafdb_healthy_bank.schema.json) is
designed for files produced by myocard-iafdb-pipeline against IAFDB data.
